TEST signal_workflow_with_response

RECEIVE HTTP:POST /signal
WITH {{payloads/signal_workflow_http_req.json}}

EXPECT GRPC:workflow.v1.WorkflowService/SignalWorkflow
WITH {{payloads/signal_workflow_request.yaml}}
RETURNS {{payloads/signal_workflow_response.json}}

RESPOND HTTP:200
WITH {{payloads/signal_workflow_http_resp.json}}
